{"id":"prora","name":"Prora","qid":"Q685448","country":"Germany","locality":"Binz","lat":"54.43408","lon":"13.57527","built":"1936","year":1936,"year_text":"1936","century":"20th century","era":"20th century and later","period":"","date_basis":"description text (approximate)","style":"Nazi architecture","heritage":"architectural heritage monument in Mecklenburg-Vorpommern","type":"human settlement; Ortsteil; historic site; architectural ensemble; groundscraper","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prora","text":"The Colossus of Prora, commonly known as simply \"Prora\", is a building complex in the municipality of Binz on the island of Rügen, Germany. It was built by Nazi Germany between 1936 and 1939 as part of the Strength Through Joy (Kraft durch Freude or KdF) project. It consisted of eight identical buildings and was 4.5 km (2+3⁄4 mi) in length parallel to the beach, with the surviving structures stretching 3.0 km (1+7⁄8 mi).","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prora","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-95d7c636c162","w":1200,"h":899,"title":"20-07-06-Prora-RalfR-DJI 0120.jpg","o":"gh-95d7c636c162.jpg","credit":{"text":"Ralf Roletschek","license":"CC BY-SA 1.0 fi","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/1.0/fi/deed.en","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20-07-06-Prora-RalfR-DJI_0120.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-v--prora","game":"civilization-v","name":"Prora","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-p61615787b13","w":972,"h":568,"o":"gh-p61615787b13.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization V, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Prora_completion_art_(Civ5).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Wiman'Chec on 2023-10-09"}}]}]}